You're replaceable, too!

368
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,540
Did you know that, Ray?

369
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,060
You're just as replaceable as me!

370
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,980
Oh, no!

371
00:18:24,980 --> 00:18:34,700
The instrumentality committee dissolved the Gehearn Research Organization.

372
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:41,620
In order to execute the project that Gehearn had conceived, a new special organization called Nerve was formed.

373
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:51,680
All of Gehearn's existing personnel were transferred into Nerve, all except one, the one who had rendered such a remarkable service to the Magi's system, Dr. Akaki.

374
00:18:51,680 --> 00:19:01,060
Is that you?

375
00:19:01,060 --> 00:19:02,300
Yes, it is.

376
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,120
It's been a while, hasn't it?

377
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:08,580
You know, this action will probably result in your death.

378
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:12,960
All I want is to get closer to the truth, to have it in my grasp.

379
00:19:16,100 --> 00:19:16,620
Here.

380
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:18,380
