381
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:20,300
Is it over now?

382
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:21,280
Yes, it is.

383
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:23,560
A solution to the problem has been found.

384
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,680
I see.

385
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,260
