390
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:45,360
Oh, hi.

391
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:48,060
And there's one more thing to trouble you with.

392
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:50,820
I've been growing flowers.

393
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,280
I'd appreciate it if you could water them for me.

394
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,120
Shinji knows where they are.

395
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:00,120
Katsuragi, the truth is with you.

396
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,740
Don't hesitate.

397
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:03,140
Move ahead.

398
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:09,060
If I can see you again, I will say the words that I could not say eight years ago.

399
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:10,860
Bye.

400
00:21:10,860 --> 00:21:14,540
