401
00:21:15,380 --> 00:21:21,020
You fool.

402
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:26,340
You're always such a fool.

403
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:34,980
God damn it.

404
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:50,720
All I could do was run.

405
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:52,380
Run away from Misato.

406
